        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6321, Emergency Egress Mortise Lock Body for Handlesets with Knobs / Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a mortise lock body for use on handlesets. It has an emergency egress function so that a single turn of an interior knob will unlock the mortise. It has a 2-1/2 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Entry Mortise Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>1\" (25mm) throw Deadbolt with saw-proof inserts</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
